  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Perhaps a text box allowing entry of a version label and a button to create a new version (with that label) would be sufficient.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "attrs": {
        "accessLevel": "",
        "id": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
        "text": "@Andrew Woods"
       },
       "type": "mention"
      },
      {
       "text": " wonders if this was an included (and since removed) feature and recommends investigating that before proceeding with the (likely simple) implementation.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "See REST-API: ",
