  "description": "<p>Perhaps a text box allowing entry of a version label and a button to create a new version (with that label) would be sufficient.  </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" data-account-id=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" accountid=\"60785ded115da6006f540529\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Andrew Woods</a> wonders if this was an included (and since removed) feature and recommends investigating that before proceeding with the (likely simple) implementation.</p>\n\n<p>See REST-API: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Versioning\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Versioning</a></p>",
